    "text": "Silicon Valley\nwebsite\nSan Francisco Bay Area, California\nSeniors are the fastest-growing age group in the Bay Area, and nationwide\nBy Grant StringerHarriet Rowan,\n25 minutes agoThe Bay Area isn’t getting any younger. In fact, new data released by the U.S. Census Bureau on Wednesday shows that the region’s population of seniors is growing fast. Meanwhile, the Bay Area’s youth and middle-aged population is stagnant and even declining in some counties. That’s nerve-wracking...",
